    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage itself, while the dense carrier continues through the method flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier, then it is split into windows that preserve the spatial field. The compact DQ-CTM process ticks repeatedly inside that stage, with parameters shared across ticks. The decoder reads the updated carrier after the thought process has finished.",
